@HealthBeauty.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5230

GET {{HealthBeauty.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/services
Accept: application/json

###

### Register a test customer
POST {{HealthBeauty.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "hoTen": "Test Customer",
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeThisPassword123!",
  "soDienThoai": "0900000000"
}

###

### Login
POST {{HealthBeauty.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@example.com",
  "password": "ChangeThisPassword123!"
}
